  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.32\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.32 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.31\n- First published release of this package.\n- Adds the Android Play Integrity Firebase App Check provider.\n- Targets `net10.0-android` without a MAUI dependency, using `Xamarin.Google.Android.Play.Integrity`.\n- `UseAndroid()` defaults to the core debug/custom provider; `AppCheckAndroidProvider.PlayIntegrity` selects native attestation and is a composition error when combined with a core provider.\n- Options: `Provider`, `CloudProjectNumber`, and `IntegrityTimeout` (30 seconds by default).\n- Registers an App Check request interceptor that attaches the token to outgoing calls.\n- Firebase challenge and token exchange stay in FireForNet App Check core; no `Xamarin.Firebase.*` packages are referenced.",
